    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d297">

                <pb facs="0365" n="281" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp02/pg281"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72113/435</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in Switzerland</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-01-28T20:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 28, 1918, 8 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1414. For Berlin:</p>
                <p>Please report fully by cable as soon as possible on the status of American
                    property in Germany as affected by official acts of the German Government since
                    the existence of a state of war between the United States and Germany;
                    particularly whether an alien property custodian has been appointed to take
                    charge of and control American property. If so, please forward official
                    regulations and ask German Government to furnish you at quarterly intervals, for
                    transmission to the Department, detailed reports concerning the taking over of
                    American property. Repeat <hi rendition="#italic">mutatis mutandis</hi> to
                    Vienna.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
